s that he can't stay away from her and is saving her at every possible moment he can.<br /><br />Charlotte is desperate to find a way out of this horrible arrangement her father made and Conner just happens to be there and gives her a solution. The story really takes off from that point and their bond just grows as the story goes on. We get to really enjoy their relationship and how much they grow to care for one another. They are themselves around one another which is enjoyable. The misunderstandings are cleared up nicely, there is a little intrigue mixed in, the secondary characters are brought in seamlessly, they have their intimate moments and the ending closes up nicely. I highly recommend this book. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/15865967?shelf=historical-scottish-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">historical-scottish-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/15865967?shelf=romance-favorites" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">romance-favorites</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,