ng book. I was shocked, I cried, I laughed, and I thought about buying a ticket to Scotland. I love Charlotte's inner strength and the energy she exudes. Nothing is impossible for that girl. Plus, Conner is unbelievably sexy and tries to take care of his women. That's right, he isn't just a pretty face. He has sisters and a clan that all look to him. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMcKnight's writing is amazing. The flow is great, the conversations are thrilling, and the romance isn't over the top. I definitely think this is the historical book everyone should check out. I can't wait for book 2 to come out! No seriously, I can't wait! ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HUYIKFP3H2N7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:5872918":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":5872918,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1782406864i/5872918._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":5,"textReviewsCount":344,"name":"Gabrielle Garza","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/5872918-gabrielle-garza","contributor":null,"id":5872918},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX7NG9G4A2LE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX7NG9G4A2LE"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX7NG9G4A2LE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX7NG9G4A2LE","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX7NG9G4A2LE"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":