orical-scottish-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/15865967?shelf=historical-scottish-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance-favorites","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/15865967?shelf=romance-favorites"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5805595415"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023093012.a02800bd-495b-4664-a515-d34f80b87b7f":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023093012.a02800bd-495b-4664-a515-d34f80b87b7f","creator":{"__ref":"User:15865967"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1696079812081,"createdAt":1696077227847,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1696079812081,"text":"Queen of Emeralds is the first book of this series and can be read as a standalone. I have to say that this book surprised me a bit. I really enjoyed it from start to finish. This is Charlotte and Conner’s story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLady Charlotte is an independent thinker who has a big personality and heart. Her mother passed when she was young and her father always allowed her to run free and be who she was. Her dream is to marry and have the freedoms she enjoys now with the hope of opening up her own home for orphaned children. Now that her season is here her father fears that she will not find a suitable husband and makes an arrangement for her to marry his oldest friend. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLaird Conner MacLeod is in London and he is making rare appearances at some of the seasons soirees. His life is full with his sisters and his duties to his Keep, but he does not have a woman to share life with. He stumbles upon Lady Charlotte and there is an instant attraction to her that he can't deny. He finds that he can't stay away from her and is saving her at every possible moment he can.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCharlotte is desperate to find a way out of this horrible arrangement her father made and Conner just happens to be there and gives her a solution. The story really takes off from that point and their bond just grows as the story goes on. We get to really enjoy their relationship and how much they grow to care for one another. They are themselves around one another which is enjoyable. The misunderstandings are cleared up nicely, there is a little intrigue mixed in, the secondary characters are brought in seamlessly, they have their intimate moments and the ending closes up nicely. I highly recommend this book. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1A25P4PGSRMZ0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:55446763":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":55446763,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1515352926i/55446763._UX200_CR0,77,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":1008,"name":"Sophie Constable","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/55446763-sophie-constable","contributor":null,"id":55446763},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A23H1VOL3V93QH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A23H1VOL3V93QH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A23H1VOL3V93QH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A23H1VOL3V93QH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A23H1VOL3V93QH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55446763?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"history","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55446763?shelf=history"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"read-on-kindle","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55446763?shelf=read-on-kindle"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"really-didn-t-enjoy-this","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55446763?shelf=really-didn-t-enjoy-this"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55446763?shelf=romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"will-not-read-again","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55446763?shelf=will-not-read-again"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5879428507"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Byy3qpH3uSkAgF19NSZvTQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Byy3qpH3uSkAgF19NSZvTQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:55446763"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1756068838023,"createdAt":1756068275110,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1756068837843,"text":"I did not like this book. I thought the characters and romance was fine if a little cliché and the female lead felt like a 21st century woman. The pacing was also a little off and the climax in particular felt rushed. I also found some of the dialogue to be a little clunky and the plot to be a little predicatable. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHowever, my main issue with this book is its historical setting, as it just made no sense. I couldn't figure out what time period this book is supposed to take place in as the parts in England had a Victorian vibe (with electric street lights, trains, and coming out balls) while the bits in Scotland seemed to take place in the medieval period. This was very confusing, but it also affected the book in another way. Multiple times in the story the phrase 'Scottish law is different from English law' is used and that 'English laws don't matter in Scotland' which is fine if the book has a medieval setting but if it takes place during the Victorian period then it doesn't work. While I am not an expert on Victorian Britain, during that time Scotland didn't have its own parliament, therefore I highly doubt there was much difference, if any at all, between English and Scottish law. This wouldn't have been a problem if the book's whole entire plot did not hinge on the idea that Scottish law and English law were fundamentally different, and so every time this got brought up it took me out of the story completely as I tried to make sense of the setting. \u003cbr /\u003eI don't understand why this wasn't just set in the medieval period, but as it stands I cannot recommend this book. ","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A23H1VOL3V93QH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:6516365":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":6516365,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1638143262i/6516365._UX200_CR0,100,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":543,"name":"Shelly","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/6516365-shelly","contributor":null,"id":6516365},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3C763P4AU5PXO":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3C763P4AU5PXO"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3C763P4AU5PXO\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3C763P4AU5PXO","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3C763P4AU5PXO"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"s