ef":"User:4833715"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1781395864634,"createdAt":1781395864462,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1781395864462,"text":"In boxed set - \"The Scottish Stone Series: Books 1-4\"","rating":0,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AJDRQRH7P3JZF\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:57276966":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":57276966,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1467334122i/57276966._UY200_CR50,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":43,"textReviewsCount":538,"name":"Dawn West","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/57276966-dawn-west","contributor":null,"id":57276966},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AFCWEP7X767U3":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AFCWEP7X767U3"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AFCWEP7X767U3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AFCWEP7X767U3","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AFCWEP7X767U3"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57276966?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"historical","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57276966?shelf=historical"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57276966?shelf=romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6298967374"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.eCqgdol8s7tC7efgVNYJog":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.eCqgdol8s7tC7efgVNYJog","creator":{"__ref":"User:57276966"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1709054010861,"createdAt":1499617073475,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1499617506884,"text":"\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1467343309i/19581453.png\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e**Disclaimer: I received a complimentary copy of this book.**\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhere can I find my own Scottish hunk with a castle?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1499617480ra/23251622.gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCharlotte isn't looking for a husband. If it were up to her, she'd stay free to roam the countryside forever. Unfortunately, her father doesn't agree with her desire for independence. He knows that if she doesn't marry, she will be at the mercy of her male relatives. To fix the situation, he plans a ball in her honor with hopes of finding a suitor among the eligible bachelors of London.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat Charlotte's father didn't expect was for a Scottish clan chieftain to swoop in and catch Charlotte's eye. Conner is nothing like the boring titled men that Charlotte is expected to marry. He values a female opinion and doesn't conform to society's strict expectations. To Charlotte, he's a breath of fresh air in a stuffy ballroom.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTheir pairing isn't well-received and even Charlotte has reservations about Conner's rumored history with women. However, when her father arranges Charlotte's marriage to a vile man, the Scot is the first one she turns to. Yet, being swept away to a highland castle isn't enough to keep Charlotte safe as danger lurks in the most unsuspecting of places...\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis was a fun ride from start to finish! I knew how this couple's story ends because I've read the second book of this series but even that did not diminish my enjoyment of this book. The pacing is steady and the plot has several twists and turns I didn't see coming. I won't give anything away but I will say that the ending was suspenseful and I held my breath until the final page.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt was nice to get to know the spunky Charlotte and see how she came to lock eyes with the handsome chieftain. Conner was a fantastic hero with tender and dominant traits plus a dash of humor. Perfect combination in my opinion. The pair together were just adorable and their chemistry was off the charts.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe villains are crude and it was easy to despise them. I always appreciate a good villain that I can hate and this book actually has two of them. Add in the naive father and there was a lot of conflict for our heroine to overcome. Conner's sisters were a nice addition to the story and I hope we get to see more of them in future books of this series.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn closing...\u003cbr\u003eIf you like feisty heroines and Scottish lairds, this is the book for you! Five suns!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFull review on blog: \u003ca href=\"https://uptildawnbookblog.blogspot.com/2017/07/review-queen-of-emeralds-by-kelsey.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003ehttps://uptildawnbookblog.blogspot.com/2017/07/review-queen-of-emeralds-by-kelsey.html\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AFCWEP7X767U3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.a-5HfARcjIEMKbRnGIM-ag":{"__typename":"Contributor","id":"kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.a-5HfARcjIEMKbRnGIM-ag","works":{"__typename":"ContributorWorksConnection","totalCount":12}},"User:10404439":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10404439,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1455153167i/10404439._UY200_CR77,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":true,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":141,"textReviewsCount":63,"name":"Cassandra Fear","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10404439-cassandra-fear","contributor":{"__ref":"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.a-5HfARcjIEMKbRnGIM-ag"},"id":10404439},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3NBCU8YY2E3GX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3NBCU8YY2E3GX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3NBCU8YY2E3GX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3NBCU8YY2E3GX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3NBCU8YY2E3GX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10404439?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6298967871"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.NtYb4q0uVLMBWMzh4PKRFg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.NtYb4q0uVLMBWMzh4PKRFg","creator":{"__ref":"User:10404439"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1709054023736,"createdAt":1491227704928,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1491228229786,"text":"Holy cow. This was an amazing historical read. I have always had a thing for Scotland and love reading about the era when there were lairds and clans and the way of life back then. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCharlotte Holloway is promised in marriage to a horrible man named Richard who has already beaten her and treats her like she is absolutely nothing but a breeding cow. She sees no way out as her father won't open his eyes and see the truth, until she meets Conner MacLeod. He is a Laird, a King in his own right, and seems positively smitten with Charlotte, so he becomes her hero.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShe swats away his advances time and again, even though she feels the pull between them. There have been a lot of rumors spoken to her about Conner and she chose to believe them, even though not one of them had been true. She feels like a fool once she finds out the truth and everything falls into place. I love the chemistry between Conner and Charlotte. They can actually have a real conversation, too. It isn't all about jumping into bed and kissing, which is a nice change from some of these romance books. Because they talk, it is easy to relate with both of them, and they became very real characters for me.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRichard never gives up his claim on Charlotte, though. So, she might just need her hero after all. The plot of this story moves at a very nice pace. I didn't fall out of the story at all, but kept reading and flipping pages. I absolutely loved the details and with them it was easy to picture the places in the story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, a very promising debut novel from Ms. McKnight and I look forward to reading even more. I highly recommend this read! It was fantastic!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3NBCU8YY2E3GX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:63802289":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":63802289,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1484356971i/63802289._UY200_CR77,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":554,"name":"Dee Winston","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/63802289-dee-winston","contributor":null,"id":63802289},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2I2H7PZM705NR":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2I2H7PZM705NR"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2I2H7PZM705NR\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2I2H7PZM705NR","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2I2H7PZM705NR"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/63802289?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6298968198"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.JE8HuFw7QvYTCNueL1B7rQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.JE8HuFw7QvYTCNueL1B7rQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:63802289"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1709054032418,"createdAt":1494453943515,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1494454068920,"text":"Charlotte just wanted to live her life free. She didn't want to be tied down to any man. But her father was making her find a man this season. So she figured she would just find a man to let her do the things she wanted to. Her father had other plans. He wanted a stable man that would not squander her dowry and leave her desolate and he had just the man. His old friend Richard, who Charlotte detested upon meeting him. Connor came to her rescue and took her away to his lair in Scotland. Little be known to Charlotte Connor had his eye or her and wanted to make her his wife. She figured he was helping a maiden in trouble. Overtime she came to care for him and Love him. But there are people who are trying to keep them apart . But Connor will keep whoever he loves and care safe with his life. I loved how Connor turned out not to be the man she thought. He let Charlotte be who she wanted and loved her for who she was.. Everybody needs a Connor. Can't wait to see more from Kelsey Mcknight. Maybe Penelope's story","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2I2H7PZM705NR\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.wik-OJipUb1GCMg0_OSz0g":{"__typename":"Contributor","id":"kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.wik-OJipUb1GCMg0_OSz0g","works":{"__typename":"ContributorWorksConnection","totalCount":30}},"User:51014822":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":51014822,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1464054705i/51014822._UY200_CR50,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":true,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":131,"textReviewsCount":37,"name":"Grace Risata","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/51014822-grace-risata","contributor":{"__ref":"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.wik-OJipUb1GCMg0_OSz0g"},"id":51014822},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1LHMKJ4BIZM7F":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LHMKJ4BIZM7F"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LHMKJ4BIZM7F\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1LHMKJ4BIZM7F","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LHMKJ4BIZM7F"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.FYnAl9_nATURMz1c1XIXdQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.go